{
 "version": 1,
 "rule": "sync/push-result",
 "_doc": "POST /api/sync/push as built (server/internal/sync/sync.go Push, api/handlers_sync.go handleSyncPush), re-derived from the code, plus item 4's typed counting. Each case runs on a fresh server: user alice with workspace $ws, bob with $bobWs, the built-in plugins registered; setup rows are stored first with their stamps. A 200 answer is JSON with exactly keys (every one always present); json is the whole body. Other statuses: text is the whole plain-text body (http.Error appends a newline), textPrefix its start, json a JSON body. stored: what must hold afterwards (events: count of alice's events; pluginData: alice's live plugin keys besides the setup rows; cards: alice's live typed card ids; pluginDataValue: stored data by key; cardVersionUnchanged: the setup card kept its version). \"$string:n\" is a JSON string of n 'x' characters; \"$jsonPadded:n\" a valid JSON body of n bytes. Decoded by server/internal/sync and api contract_push_test.go (B5) and the web's PushResult (C2).",
 "keys": [
  "eventsAccepted",
  "eventDuplicates",
  "dataAccepted",
  "dataSkipped",
  "dataRefused"
 ],
 "limits": {
  "bodyBytes": 8388608,
  "itemBytes": 262144
 },
 "cases": [
  {
   "name": "events, a plugin row and a typed card are accepted",
   "body": {
    "events": [
     {
      "id": "01JD9A00000000000000000001",
      "workspaceId": "$ws",
      "device": "phone",
      "ts": "2026-11-12T09:50:00Z",
      "type": "review",
      "payload": {}
     }
    ],
    "pluginData": [
     {
      "pluginId": "qinqin-core",
      "key": "notecfg",
      "workspaceId": "$ws",
      "data": {
       "v": 1
      },
      "updatedAt": "2026-11-12T09:00:00Z"
     }
    ],
    "cards": [
     {
      "workspaceId": "$ws",
      "id": "c-vocab-1201",
      "kind": "vocab",
      "entryId": 1201,
      "written": null,
      "entryKind": null,
      "sentenceId": null,
      "skipKinds": [],
      "deckIds": [
       "general"
      ],
      "createdAt": "2026-11-10T08:00:00Z",
      "extra": {},
      "updatedAt": "2026-11-12T10:00:00Z",
      "deletedAt": null
     }
    ]
   },
   "expect": {
    "status": 200,
    "json": {
     "eventsAccepted": 1,
     "eventDuplicates": 0,
     "dataAccepted": 2,
     "dataSkipped": 0,
     "dataRefused": 0
    }
   },
   "stored": {
    "events": 1,
    "pluginData": [
     "notecfg"
    ],
    "cards": [
     "c-vocab-1201"
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "name": "an event id already stored is a duplicate, not an error",
   "setup": {
    "events": [
